(text "3.1 V supervisor: load inhibits plus independent discharge cutoff on sheet 11" (at 19.05 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 678d5f95-d7c5-5b26-872c-84a1c0bc79c4))
(text "R46 now pulls RESET_N to raw CELL_P. Q12/Q13 remain effective after protected VBAT disappears.\nQ9/Q10/Q11 retain the existing logic and motor inhibits; R64 defaults the motor request low.\nU7 retains independent overvoltage/current/short protection and its factory 2.6 V UV threshold.\nThis is not a zero-leakage storage disconnect: the supervisor, protector and cutoff bias still use cell current." (at 25.4 241.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid eea7bb77-3553-589c-ada5-d1c8982b004d))
